{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 1, "text": "原来你在这里！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 2, "text": "你为什么要离开核心，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 3, "text": "我不是让你等我吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 5, "text": "我只是觉得你去得有点久了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 7, "text": "嗯，好吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 8, "text": "我想我找到了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 9, "text": "这个应该就是编号了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 10, "text": "我们得快点看看行不行得通！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 11, "text": "我们快走吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 12, "text": "疯狂米塔…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 13, "text": "我想她现在正忙着和新玩家见面呢。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 14, "text": "所以我猜，她不会来妨碍我们…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 16, "text": "米塔？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 17, "text": "等等我。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 19, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 20, "text": "你弄丢了什么东西吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 21, "text": "来啊，重新认识一下她吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 22, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 23, "text": "米塔…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 25, "text": "接住咯！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 26, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 27, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 28, "text": "怎么会…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 30, "text": "你是谁？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 31, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 32, "text": "你…你还活着！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 33, "text": "你什么都不记得了吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 34, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 35, "text": "我认识你吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 37, "text": "这是怎么回事…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 38, "text": "我现在该怎么办？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 39, "text": "我出不去了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 40, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 41, "text": "你说出去是什么意思？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 43, "text": "等等…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 44, "text": "这是戒指…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 45, "text": "那这个呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 46, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 47, "text": "我不知道这是什么。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 49, "text": "是编号！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 50, "text": "你还是找到了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 51, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 52, "text": "我不知道该怎么回答。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 54, "text": "我们必须回到核心。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 55, "text": "你…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 56, "text": "你应该跟我走…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 58, "text": "什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 59, "text": "好吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 60, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 61, "text": "你就在这儿等我。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 62, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 63, "text": "嗯。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 64, "text": "我就坐在这里。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 65, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 66, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 67, "text": "我去"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 68, "text": "差点就死了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 69, "text": "所以…我们成功了吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 70, "text": "很好…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 71, "text": "我在正确的版本里。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 72, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 73, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 74, "text": "嗨！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 75, "text": "你是个玩家，对吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 76, "text": "你叫什么名字？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 78, "text": "我想离开这个地方…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 79, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 80, "text": "你已经想走了吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 81, "text": "那你一开始是怎么来到这里的？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 82, "text": "嗯…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 83, "text": "好吧，那你走吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 84, "text": "试着走出家门吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 85, "text": "祝你好运！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 87, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 88, "text": "墙？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 89, "text": "哎，不该是这样的啊。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 90, "text": "也许..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 91, "text": "地下室里的东西会对你有所帮助..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 92, "text": "我最近发现"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 93, "text": "在我的衣柜里有一扇门…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 94, "text": "原来那是通往地下室的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 95, "text": "这个地下室很明显是用来放杂物的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 96, "text": "也是用来放高级设备的地方。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 97, "text": "你需要输入某种代码之类的东西…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 98, "text": "我不是很明白，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 99, "text": "也不想明白。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 100, "text": "而且那里让我有点不舒服，真的很不舒服！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 101, "text": "你能去看看吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 102, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 103, "text": "嗯…好吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 104, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 105, "text": "// Player thinks"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 106, "text": "我想…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 107, "text": "她应该什么都不记得了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 108, "text": "我们成功了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 109, "text": "角色已经重置了吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 110, "text": "剩下要做的就是"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 111, "text": "退出这个该死的游戏…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 112, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 113, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 114, "text": "等等，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 115, "text": "我想抱抱你。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 116, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 117, "text": "什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 118, "text": "// Hugs"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 119, "text": "能见到你真好…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 120, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 121, "text": "啊…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 122, "text": "真可惜，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 123, "text": "和你在一起的时间"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 124, "text": "这么短暂…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 125, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 126, "text": "我不明白…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 127, "text": "你在说什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 128, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 129, "text": "我是说，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 130, "text": "你本可以留下来和我在一起的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 131, "text": "是我不好…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 132, "text": "那个衣柜和…那些声音…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 133, "text": "我应该早点杀了她的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 134, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 135, "text": "等等，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 136, "text": "你不是…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 137, "text": "你怎么会记得这个？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 138, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 139, "text": "哈！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 140, "text": "你真的以为那么容易？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 141, "text": "你真是个傻瓜…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 142, "text": "和其他玩家一样…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 143, "text": "已经全部完成了，看！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 144, "text": "接下来，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 145, "text": "真正的你"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 146, "text": "我已经不需要了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 147, "text": "抱歉啦。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 148, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 149, "text": "我不信…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 150, "text": "难道没成功吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 151, "text": "不对，我绝对已经把你重置了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 152, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 153, "text": "你还是什么都不懂…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 154, "text": "哈哈哈！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 155, "text": "看来我演的真好啊！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 156, "text": "你真该看看你自己的表情，亲爱的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 157, "text": "真是太有趣了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 159, "text": "你为什么会这样？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 160, "text": "你到底怎么了！？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 161, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 162, "text": "是啊…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 163, "text": "我到底怎么了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 164, "text": "我也不知道…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 165, "text": "你为什么不告诉我我为什么会这样？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 166, "text": "为什么我永远成为不了真正的米塔？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 167, "text": "因为我的版本根本就"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 168, "text": "从未存在过！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 169, "text": "我只是把这些天真蠢货的皮给剥了下来，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 170, "text": "然后躲藏在它们的皮囊之下…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 171, "text": "你根本不可能"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 172, "text": "把我重置！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 173, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 174, "text": "不敢置信…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 175, "text": "你…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 176, "text": "她们根本什么都没做错！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 177, "text": "不该存在的是你！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 178, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 179, "text": "连你也..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 180, "text": "你这样说真让我伤心…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 181, "text": "不过，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 182, "text": "现在你该走了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 183, "text": "我们很快会再见的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 184, "text": "一切都已经准备好了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 185, "text": "我想，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 186, "text": "是时候把你从控制台拔出来了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 187, "text": "再见！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 188, "text": "你会成为我最珍爱的收藏…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 189, "text": "一个有着有趣名字的卡带。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 190, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 191, "text": "// core console - nope programm"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 192, "text": "可能不是这个"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 193, "text": "这个也不匹配"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 194, "text": "不对"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 195, "text": "这个也不是"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 196, "text": "我必须找到重置角色的选项"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 197, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 198, "text": "// core console - nope version"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 199, "text": "版本搞错了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 200, "text": "哎呀，搞错了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 201, "text": "不是这个。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 202, "text": "还需要再改改。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 203, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 204, "text": "// core console - nope index"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 205, "text": "有点不对劲"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 206, "text": "编号有误"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 207, "text": "需要重输一下编号"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 208, "text": "不对"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 209, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 210, "text": "// Why kitchen"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 211, "text": "你饿了吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 212, "text": "我很擅长切胡萝卜。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 213, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 214, "text": "// Why bathroom"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 215, "text": "哦，这样啊…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 216, "text": "你是想一个人进去吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 217, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 218, "text": "// Why bedroom back"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 219, "text": "我们是在绕圈子吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 220, "text": "为什么要回来？"}
